	(text "To use with boost regulator U1:\n* Connect battery to BAT+ and GND(-)\n\nTo skip regulator:\n* Connect battery to VCC(+) and GND(-)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 28.956 177.546 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e396bb9-c28c-4e8f-8fa8-1892dda2203f")
	)
	(text "Power regulator"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.872 130.556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "63d57860-ec41-43c5-8731-b6fa2542f402")
	)
	(text "ETA1061V33S2G without R6 nor R7\nVCC = 3.3\n\n - OR - \n\nETA1061S2G with R6 and R7\nfor adjustable custom voltage\nVCC = (R6+R7)/R7 * 1.11V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.584 180.848 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6ef4c4af-3964-4ed5-a29c-3480b8118381")
	)
	(text "LED configuration (shown):\n* Skip D3 \"Bulb\"\n* Bridge over JP1 \"SkipBulb\"\n* R2 and R3 act as just heaters for the flame/blowing out sensor\n* Works best arround 100-150R\n\n* Populate D1 and D2 with LEDs of choice\n* Adjust R4 and R5 freely, to desired light level\n* 68R produces a cozy 10mA glow\n\n* Adjust R1 for reliable performance\n* 10k is a decent starting point\n* REDUCE resistance if candle impossible to blow out\n* INCREASE resistance if candle turns off by itself\n\n* Populate U2 with 3v3 variant of ETA1061: \"ETA1061V33S2G\"\n* +BATT input: 1.0 - 3.3V\n* Works great with 2xAA NiMH (example: IKEA LADDA 1900mAh)\n\n\n\nDecent lightbulb configuration:\n* Populate R2 and R3 with 33R each\n* Populate D3 \"Bulb\" with 1.5V tungsten filament bulb\n* Open JP1 \"SkipBulb\"\n* Skip D1, D2, R4 and R5\n* Otherwise same as LED configuration\n\n\n\nMinimal lightbulb configuration:\n* Skip U1, C1, C2 and L1\n* Supply with 3xAA or 3xAAA batteries into VCC pin\n* Keep adjusting R1 until reliable performance\n* Otherwise same as \"Decent lightbulb configuration\"\n\n\n\nA combination of lightbulb + (colorful!) LEDs is also possible.\nThe exact configuration has been left as an excersize to the reader."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120.904 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7e961e7b-eb15-424e-b4ff-b473d8e62e06")
	)
	(text " HEAT\n<---->\nTRANSFER\n"
